      "start": 33.15,
      "end": 38.9,
      "text": "Strong sun can make paint dry too fast and leave marks. Paint that side in the morning while it's still shaded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 42.94,
      "end": 48.08,
      "text": "Then Wednesday morning it is. Just wait until any dew on the wood has dried off before you start."
